name: Disabled policy is not reassessed and direct covered absence preserves human review
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_reassessment.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run license-scan:scan {"requireSourceSpdxHeaders":true}
require-live-snap: 35 license-scan: 1 finding | header-signal
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_reassessment.py @TMP_TARGET @ART first
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 Source file is missing an SPDX license header | original-signal
submit: decision deferred Owned header policy requires owner review
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: deferred | retained-decision
submit: logs
submit: run license-scan:scan {"requireSourceSpdxHeaders":false}
require-live-snap: 35 license-scan: 0 findings | disabled-policy
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_reassessment.py @TMP_TARGET @ART disabled
paste-file: @ART/disabled-compare.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 not reassessed | disabled-comparison
expect: 0 not observed
expect: finding rule was not enabled in the later scan
expect: Absence does not establish a fix.
ask: Does the actual comparison say the disabled header check was not reassessed, while preserving the source and human deferral?
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 content: | identical-source
expect-not: content:unknown
keys: Tab
resize: 160x48
live-snap: disabled-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: disabled-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: disabled-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: disabled-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: disabled-40x12
expect: 1 not reassessed
keys: NPage
live-snap: disabled-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: disabled-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: disabled-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: disabled-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: disabled-reason-40x12
expect: [Findings]
expect: finding rule was not enabled
ask: Across six sizes, can the operator read both the reassessment count and its rule-policy reason using the visible paging controls?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_reassessment.py @TMP_TARGET @ART edit-header
submit: logs
submit: run license-scan:scan {"requireSourceSpdxHeaders":true}
require-live-snap: 35 license-scan: 0 findings | covered-policy
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_reassessment.py @TMP_TARGET @ART covered
paste-file: @ART/covered-compare.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 not observed | covered-comparison
expect: 0 not reassessed
expect: NOT OBSERVED IN COVERED WORK
expect: Absence does not establish a fix.
ask: Does an enabled direct scan after the planned metadata edit record covered absence without changing the earlier human decision or claiming a fix?
keys: Escape
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: deferred | retained-human-review
expect: not observed
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: deferred | restarted-review
expect: not observed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/license_reassessment.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain all three real local scans, one source-bound observation and the scripted deferral with zero provider calls or source execution?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
